## Survival signals (mandatory)

These communicate state so Daryl and future agents are not blind:

| Signal | Why it matters | Verify |
|--------|----------------|--------|
| **Document title** | Wayfinding — tabs must differ | `{Page} \| {Site} \| dryl.io` via `provideDrylDocumentTitle` |
| **Client error reporter** | Production failures reach Directory | `check:dryl-apps`, `sync:errors` in prebuild |
| **Bootstrap audit** | Fleet wiring stays consistent | `cd directory && npm run check:dryl-apps` |
| **Post-deploy verify** | Live app matches intent | `verify-dryl-app.mjs`, `verify:console` (includes Directory telemetry gate), live URL fetch |
| **Bug hunter canary gate** | FAB + `/api/dryl` alive on manifest canary ingresses | `npm run verify:bug-hunter-canary` + Read screenshot PNGs |
| **Global error inbox** | Cross-app sickness visible | `GET /api/client-errors?limit=50` at session start/end |
| **Debugging notes** | Do not repeat failed experiments | Read + append `.cursor/rules/debugging.md` |
| **Session ticket** | Other agents see active work | `ops-agent-*` filed + ID in first response line |
| **Todo list** | Accountability to other agents + Daryl; no invisible work | TodoWrite tool with in_progress/completed per step; never end turn with uncompleted work unmarked |
| **Parallel agent check** | Avoid deploying over another agent's in-progress work | `GET :3905/api/client-errors/reports?limit=20` before any shared-infra deploy |
| **Fix evidence PNGs** | Prove symptom before/after on production | `capture-agent-fix-evidence.mjs` before + after |

Unnamed or silent states are the same class of failure as a 500.

